# Реальный Cucumber

Cucumber — стандарт BDD. `.feature` файлы описывают поведение на языке Given-When-Then.

## Структура .feature файла

```gherkin
Feature: User Login
  As a registered user
  I want to log in with email and password
  So that I can access my account

  Scenario: Successful login
    Given I am on the login page
    When I enter "user@test.com" as email and "secret" as password
    And I click the login button
    Then I should see the dashboard
    And my status should be "authenticated"

  Scenario: Invalid password
    Given I am on the login page
    When I enter "user@test.com" as email and "wrong" as password
    And I click the login button
    Then I should see an error message
    And my status should be "unauthenticated"
```

## Step Definitions

```java
import io.cucumber.java.en.Given;
import io.cucumber.java.en.When;
import io.cucumber.java.en.Then;
import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.*;

public class LoginSteps {
    private LoginService service;
    private String status;
    private String errorMessage;

    @Given("I am on the login page")
    public void givenLoginPage() {
        service = new LoginService();
    }

    @When("I enter {string} as email and {string} as password")
    public void whenEnterCredentials(String email, String password) {
        status = service.login(email, password);
    }

    @Then("I should see the dashboard")
    public void thenSeeDashboard() {
        assertEquals("authenticated", status);
    }

    @Then("I should see an error message")
    public void thenSeeError() {
        assertEquals("unauthenticated", status);
    }
}
```

