## Tag-based Execution

```gherkin
@smoke
Scenario: Successful login
  ...

@regression
Scenario: Invalid password
  ...
```

```java
@CucumberOptions(
    features = "src/test/resources/features",
    glue = "steps",
    tags = "@smoke"
)
public class RunSmokeTests {}
```

